{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Giggleland: Terry's Vegetable Patch is a free standalone experience that gives you a taste of the full Giggleland game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659070/extras/about.png?t=1749663498\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">While searching for her dad, Tolie gets trapped in an old, abandoned attraction at Giggleland Park, once based on the beloved cartoon <i>Terry's Vegetable Patch</i>. Help Tolie find her way out of the facility while uncovering the real reason it was shut down. But be careful... something else is in there with her\u2026 and it's been waiting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Terry's Vegetable Patch features its own complete story built around select content from the main game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3659070?t=1749663498","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3659070?t=1749663498","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659070/9ec806913f0876d603b5375976dc0c0ce53d4933/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749663498","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659070/9ec806913f0876d603b5375976dc0c0ce53d4933/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749663498","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Giggleland: Terry's Vegetable Patch is a free standalone experience that gives you a taste of the full Giggleland game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659070/e